#: ../../language/error_codes/E4235.md:1
msgid "E4235"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4235.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `lexscan_target_type_unknown`."
msgstr "编译器诊断名称：`lexscan_target_type_unknown`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4235.md:5
msgid ""
"The type of a `lexscan` target is not known when the expression is "
"checked. The compiler needs this type to determine whether to scan text "
"or bytes."
msgstr "检查 `lexscan` 表达式时，其目标类型尚未确定。编译器需要该类型来判断应扫描文本还是字节。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4235.md:8
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4235.md:10
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn scan_word() -> Bool {\n"
"  let scan = fn(target) {\n"
"    lexscan target {\n"
"      re\"^[a-z]+\" => true\n"
"      _ => false\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"  scan(@lexbuf.StringScanner(\"hello\"))\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4235.md:14
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4235.md:16
msgid ""
"Annotate the target or the parameter that supplies it. In this example, "
"annotate the local function's parameter rather than relying on its later "
"call to infer the type."
msgstr "为目标或提供目标的参数添加类型注解。在此例中，应为局部函数的参数添加注解，而不是依赖后续调用来推断类型。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4235.md:20
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn scan_word() -> Bool {\n"
"  let scan = fn(target : @lexbuf.StringScanner) {\n"
"    lexscan target {\n"
"      re\"^[a-z]+\" => true\n"
"      _ => false\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"  scan(@lexbuf.StringScanner(\"hello\"))\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
